              <div class="card-head">
                <div class="card-eyebrow-pair">
                  <span class="t-eyebrow-muted">01/3 &middot; Tools</span>
                  <span class="t-eyebrow">Spatial Systems</span>
                </div>
                <h2 class="t-xl">New tools to rethink how architectural work gets done.</h2>
                <p class="t-s">
                  Small applications, spatial classifiers, and computational utilities built for real architectural workflows rather than generic demos.
