            <div>
              <h2 class="t-xl" style="margin-bottom: 14px; max-width: 680px;">
                A space to explore, build, and discover what's next in architecture.
              </h2>
              <p class="t-s" style="max-width: 560px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: var(--ink-navy); opacity: 0.8;">
                Architecture AI Lab is an independent computational research space led by Jorge Ludeña. We test AI systems against real architectural constraints—documenting reproducible workflows, open benchmarks, and spatial tools.
